// PROGRAM — workouts by day.
// `text` is the standalone prescription (used when no program is running).
// `role` drives the week-by-week prescription inside a program:
//   main = primary lift (sets, reps and RPE all move by week)
//   acc  = accessory (same, lighter set counts)
//   pre  = prehab / carries / core (fixed prescription; one set fewer on deload)
// `reps` overrides the block rep ranges [BASE, BUILD, PEAK]. `rpeCap` and `maxSets`
// hold back the lifts with the highest fatigue cost (deadlift, RDL).
